Package: aic8800-firmware
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: firmware for AIC8800 USB WiFi devices
 aic8800 is the Linux device driver released for the AIC 8800 WiFi
 controllers with USB interface.
 .
 This package provides the firmware files used by the aic8800 kernel modules.

Package: aic8800-usb-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends:
 aic8800-firmware (= ${binary:Version}),
 eject,
 ${misc:Depends},
Conflicts:
 aic8800-pcie-dkms,
 aic8800-sdio-dkms,
Description: network driver for AIC8800 USB WiFi devices
 aic8800 is the Linux device driver released for the AIC 8800 WiFi
 controllers with USB interface.
 .
 This package provides the dkms source code for the aic8800 kernel modules.
 Kernel source or headers are required to compile these modules.
